    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Strength or Dexterity 13+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Strength or Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Guardian.</strong> Immediately after a creature within 5 feet of you takes the Disengage action or hits a target other than you with an attack, you can make an Opportunity Attack against it.</p><p><strong>Halt.</strong> When you hit a creature with an Opportunity Attack, its Speed becomes 0 for the rest of the current turn.</p>",
